{"id":"wb-3-93","name":"寄畅园","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"寄畅园","text":"寄畅园，又名秦园，是一座位于中国江苏省无锡市的中式古典园林，其名取自王羲之的“寄畅山水荫”。“园中有山山中有园”，把不是园子的山景也借过来成为了园林的景色，乃江南园林之代表作之一，被中国国务院列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AF%84%E7%95%85%E5%9B%AD","revisionId":95412380,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95412380","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/543cd93970280d6a6e835f41.jpg","title":"Jichang_Royal_Garden.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jichang_Royal_Garden.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/be/Jichang_Royal_Garden.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Synyan","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Jichang Royal Garden in Wuxi, China","width":320,"height":239}}